    {
      "round": 1,
      "date": "2026-11-27",
      "answers": "Most important: columns and data types, and a feel for the values. Hover a source shows the existing field Summary. Click switches the main view to a drill-in explorer: field summary, then actual rows fast; from there save or do something else. Persistence undecided (maybe scratch, maybe read-only, maybe per-source dashboard). Multi-source matters: dashboards are built on relationships; wants a flow from seeing how sources relate to building a dashboard on a slice. Wants to see which sources existing dashboards cover. Relationship/ERD view is a different action from the source hover/click."
    }
  ]
